            "Enterprise AI agents often suffer from a curious shortcoming: a lack of knowledge.",
            "Knowledge is defined as the understanding of what data means in the context of individual organizations, distinct from mere data.",
            "AI agents require this contextual understanding to adequately reason about situations and make decisions."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "企业AI智能体普遍存在一种奇特的缺陷：知识匮乏。",
            "知识不同于数据，它是指在特定组织背景下对数据意义的理解。",
            "AI智能体需要这种上下文理解才能充分推理情境并做出决策。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This knowledge gap limits the ability of enterprise AI agents to operate autonomously and make informed decisions, constraining their practical application and value within complex organizational structures.",
          "zh": "这种知识鸿沟限制了企业AI智能体自主运行和做出明智决策的能力，从而制约了它们在复杂组织结构中的实际应用和价值。"
        },
